OL,3,AUS rapper postpones O2 arena show after
OL,4,AManchester evacuation                  
OL,6,FOne person was taken to hospital and a 
OL,7,Ftotal of 89 people "displayed symptoms 
OL,8,Fbelieved to be linked to the exposure" 
OL,9,Fafter the incident during Toliver's    
OL,10,Fshow at the Co-op Live arena on Sunday 
OL,11,Fnight, police said.                    
OL,13,FFans described "distressing scenes"    
OL,14,Fwith people "choking", "screaming" and 
OL,15,F"coughing up blood" because of the     
OL,16,Feffects of an unknown substance, which 
OL,17,Fpolice initially believed to be tear   
OL,18,Fgas.                                   
